 "findings": [
  "Overall conversion 3.7% is above the Dynamic Yield global average (2.66%), but it is carried by desktop (6.2%). Mobile converts at 2.2%, only 35% of desktop, while mobile is 61% of sessions.",
  "Biggest single leak: mobile bag \u2192 checkout. Only 35% of mobile shoppers with something in the bag start checkout, vs 64% on desktop (mobile cart abandonment 70%).",
  "Small baskets: 1.24 items per order vs 2.91 for the weakest DY industry (fashion). 41% of orders pay shipping, and 20% land just under the \u20ac100 free-shipping threshold (\u20ac70\u2013100).",
  "Mobile product pages turn fewer views into add-to-bag in every category (5\u20137.5% vs 7.6\u201313.9% on desktop).",
  "Checkout itself performs well (81% of started checkouts complete, above the 66% top-10% benchmark). Search returns zero results in 15% of searches (all for 'tent')."
 ]
